# Caddy gets and renews the certificate for MURMO_DOMAIN, and passes everything, the WebSocket included, to Murmo.
# It sends X-Forwarded-For, which Murmo believes from it (MURMO_TRUST_PROXY=1: private networks, such as the compose
# network). Request bodies are not limited here; Murmo limits its own.
{$MURMO_DOMAIN} {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy murmo:8080
}
